@page "/privacy-policy"

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy | Journey Recreated</PageTitle>

<div class="legal-page">

    <div class="legal-header">
        <p class="legal-eyebrow">Journey Recreated</p>

        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p class="legal-effective-date">
            Effective Date: October 2, 2026
        </p>
    </div>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>

        <p>
            Journey Recreated is owned and operated by
            <strong>Mr. Recreated LLC</strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
            We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting
            the personal information you choose to share while using
            Journey Recreated.
        </p>

        <p>
            This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect,
            why we collect it, how it is used and protected, when it
            may be shared with service providers, and the choices you
            have regarding your information.
        </p>

        <p>
            By using Journey Recreated, you acknowledge the practices
            described in this Privacy Policy.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

        <p>
            Journey Recreated collects information that is reasonably
            necessary to provide your account, Journey experience,
            reflections, progress, purchases, and related services.
        </p>

        <h3>Account Information</h3>

        <p>
            When you create an account, we may collect information such as:
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Email address</li>
            <li>Display name</li>
            <li>Account authentication information</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            Passwords are handled through secure authentication systems.
            Journey Recreated does not display your password to us in
            readable form.
        </p>


        <h3>Profile and Onboarding Information</h3>

        <p>
            To help tailor your Journey experience, you may be asked
            to provide information such as:
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Age bracket</li>
            <li>Gender</li>
            <li>Religious background</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            Some information you voluntarily provide, such as religious
            background, may be considered sensitive personal information
            under certain privacy laws. We use this information only for
            purposes related to providing and personalizing Journey
            Recreated and do not sell it.
        </p>


        <h3>Reflection and Journey Information</h3>

        <p>
            As you use Journey Recreated, we may collect and maintain
            information associated with your use of the app, including:
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Your responses to reflection questions</li>
            <li>Optional notes you choose to enter</li>
            <li>Journey and milestone progress</li>
            <li>Dimensions you have worked through</li>
            <li>Action steps you select or save</li>
            <li>Completion and progress information</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            Your personal reflection responses and saved Journey activity
            are associated with your account and are not intended to be
            publicly visible to other Journey Recreated users.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>3. Payment Information</h2>

        <p>
            Payments for Journey Recreated are processed by
            <strong>Stripe</strong>, a third-party payment processor.
        </p>

        <p>
            Journey Recreated does <strong>not</strong> directly collect
            or store your full credit card number, debit card number,
            card security code, or complete payment-card credentials.
        </p>

        <p>
            Stripe may collect payment information and other information
            necessary to process transactions, prevent fraud, provide
            receipts, issue refunds, and comply with applicable financial
            and legal requirements. Stripe's handling of that information
            is governed by Stripe's own privacy practices.
        </p>

        <p>
            Journey Recreated may receive transaction-related information
            needed to determine whether you purchased a Journey, such as
            payment status, transaction identifiers, purchase status,
            refunds, and your entitlement to access purchased content.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>4. Information We Do Not Intentionally Collect</h2>

        <p>
            Journey Recreated does not intentionally request or collect
            the following as part of its ordinary app experience:
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Social Security numbers</li>
            <li>Government-issued identification numbers</li>
            <li>Your full payment-card credentials</li>
            <li>Bank account passwords or online banking credentials</li>
            <li>Your phone contacts or address book</li>
            <li>Photos or videos from your device without your action</li>
            <li>Microphone or camera recordings</li>
            <li>Precise GPS location</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            Please do not enter highly sensitive information that Journey
            Recreated has not requested into optional reflection notes or
            other free-text fields.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>5. Technical and Security Information</h2>

        <p>
            Like most online services, limited technical information may
            be processed automatically when you use Journey Recreated.
            This may include information such as:
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Internet Protocol (IP) address</li>
            <li>Browser or device information</li>
            <li>Authentication and security events</li>
            <li>Error and diagnostic information</li>
            <li>Request timestamps</li>
            <li>Information used to detect abuse, fraud, or automated activity</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            This information may be processed by Journey Recreated or by
            service providers that help operate, secure, authenticate,
            deliver, or maintain the application.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>6. How We Use Your Information</h2>

        <p>
            We may use personal information for purposes including:
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Creating and maintaining your account</li>
            <li>Authenticating your identity when you sign in</li>
            <li>Providing access to Journeys you have purchased or received</li>
            <li>Saving your reflection responses and progress</li>
            <li>Providing insights, guidance, and action steps within the app</li>
            <li>Remembering your Journey progress between sessions</li>
            <li>Processing and verifying purchases and refunds</li>
            <li>Providing customer support</li>
            <li>Sending necessary account or security communications</li>
            <li>Preventing fraud, abuse, unauthorized access, and automated attacks</li>
            <li>Maintaining and improving the reliability and security of the service</li>
            <li>Complying with applicable legal obligations</li>
        </ul>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>7. How We Protect Your Information</h2>

        <p>
            Journey Recreated uses reasonable technical, administrative,
            and organizational safeguards designed to protect personal
            information from unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration,
            misuse, or destruction.
        </p>

        <p>
            Security measures may include:
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Encrypted communications between your browser and online services</li>
            <li>Secure user authentication</li>
            <li>Access controls restricting users to their own account information</li>
            <li>Database-level access protections for user-specific information</li>
            <li>Protected server-side credentials and payment integrations</li>
            <li>Automated protections against bots and abusive authentication attempts</li>
            <li>Restricted administrative access to systems containing user information</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            Although we take reasonable precautions to protect your
            information, no website, application, database, or method of
            electronic transmission can be guaranteed to be completely
            secure. We therefore cannot guarantee absolute security.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>8. How We Share Information</h2>

        <p>
            Journey Recreated does <strong>not sell or rent your personal
            information</strong> to advertisers or data brokers.
        </p>

        <p>
            We may share or permit processing of limited information with
            trusted service providers when reasonably necessary to operate
            Journey Recreated. These may include providers that assist with:
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Payment processing</li>
            <li>User authentication</li>
            <li>Application hosting and delivery</li>
            <li>Database and account services</li>
            <li>Email delivery</li>
            <li>Fraud and abuse prevention</li>
            <li>Security services</li>
            <li>Technical infrastructure</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
            These providers may process information only as necessary to
            provide their respective services or as otherwise permitted
            or required by law.
        </p>

        <p>
            We may also disclose information when reasonably necessary
            to comply with applicable law, legal process, court orders,
            governmental requests, protect the security of Journey
            Recreated, investigate fraud or abuse, or protect the rights
            and safety of Mr. Recreated LLC, our users, or others.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>9. Your Reflections Are Not Shared With Other Users</h2>

        <p>
            Journey Recreated is designed so that your individual
            reflection responses, personal notes, saved action steps,
            and Journey progress are associated with your account.
        </p>

        <p>
            Other ordinary Journey Recreated users are not given access
            to another user's private reflection responses or personal
            Journey records.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>10. Cookies, Local Storage, and Similar Technologies</h2>

        <p>
            Journey Recreated may use browser storage, cookies, or similar
            technologies when necessary to maintain authentication,
            preserve application functionality, support security, and
            provide features associated with the Progressive Web App.
        </p>

        <p>
            These technologies may also be used by service providers that
            support authentication, payments, fraud prevention, security,
            or other essential application functions.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>11. Data Retention</h2>

        <p>
            We retain personal information for as long as reasonably
            necessary to provide Journey Recreated, maintain your account,
            fulfill the purposes described in this Privacy Policy, resolve
            disputes, prevent abuse, and satisfy applicable legal,
            accounting, security, or regulatory obligations.
        </p>

        <p>
            When you delete your Journey Recreated account, account-related
            personal information under our control is scheduled for deletion
            in accordance with our account-deletion processes, subject to
            information we may be required or permitted to retain for legal,
            accounting, fraud-prevention, security, transaction-record, or
            regulatory purposes.
        </p>

        <p>
            Third-party providers, including payment processors, may retain
            transaction records according to their own legal obligations and
            retention policies.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>12. Account Deletion and Your Choices</h2>

        <p>
            Journey Recreated provides an account-deletion option within
            the application Settings page.
        </p>

        <p>
            You may also contact us regarding questions about personal
            information associated with your account.
        </p>

        <p>
            Depending on where you live and the laws that apply to you,
            you may have additional rights regarding your personal
            information, which may include rights to request access,
            correction, deletion, or information about how your personal
            data is processed.
        </p>

        <p>
            Where applicable, we will respond to valid privacy requests
            as required by law.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>13. Children</h2>

        <p>
            Journey Recreated is not directed to children under the age
            of 16, and we do not knowingly seek to collect personal
            information from children under 16.
        </p>

        <p>
            If we learn that personal information from a child under 16
            has been collected in circumstances subject to applicable
            children's privacy law, we will take appropriate steps to
            address the information as required by law.
        </p>

        <p>
            If you believe that a child under 16 has provided personal
            information through Journey Recreated, please contact us.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>14. Third-Party Services and Links</h2>

        <p>
            Journey Recreated may interact with or provide links to
            third-party services, including payment and other technology
            providers.
        </p>

        <p>
            This Privacy Policy applies to Journey Recreated and does not
            govern the independent privacy practices of third-party
            websites or services. We encourage you to review the privacy
            policies of any third-party services you use.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>15. Business Transfers</h2>

        <p>
            If Mr. Recreated LLC is involved in a merger, acquisition,
            reorganization, sale of assets, financing, or similar business
            transaction, information associated with Journey Recreated may
            be transferred as part of that transaction, subject to
            applicable law and appropriate protections.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>16. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

        <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect
            changes to Journey Recreated, our practices, technology, legal
            requirements, or other operational needs.
        </p>

        <p>
            When we make material changes, we will update the effective
            date displayed at the top of this page and may provide
            additional notice where appropriate.
        </p>

        <p>
            We encourage you to review this Privacy Policy periodically.
        </p>
    </section>


    <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>17. Contact Us</h2>

        <p>
            If you have questions, concerns, or privacy-related requests
            regarding Journey Recreated, you may contact:
        </p>

        <div class="legal-contact-card">
            <strong>Mr. Recreated LLC</strong>

            <span>Journey Recreated</span>

            <a href="mailto:support@journeyrecreated.com">
                support@journeyrecreated.com
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>


    <div class="legal-footer-links">
        <a href="/refund-policy">
            Refund Policy
        </a>

        <span aria-hidden="true">•</span>

        <a href="/terms">
            Terms &amp; Conditions
        </a>
    </div>

</div>